          },
          "description": "Anxiety Buster: Busting Big Feelings is a gentle, true story about Buster, a brave doberman who didn't always feel brave.  After moving through several homes as a puppy, Buster had big feelings like zoomies, worries, and a need for quiet corners. Through short chapters, kids follow Buster as he learns to feel safe, ask for help, and grow into a confident therapy dog who helps others with their big emotions. Perfect for bedtime, car rides, or when feelings feel too big. ",
